    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>hexene</mi><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></munderover><mi>Products</mi></math></p><p>The two products formed in above reaction are</p>",
