  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Ozone will cleave carbon-carbon double bonds to give ketones/carboxylic acids after oxidative workup. Here in this reaction Cleavage occurs at unsaturation of hexene and Butanoic acid and acetic acid is formed.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c8c23681-181c-4be7-821e-7e37c6776aeb.png\" style=\"width: 465px; height: 84px;\" /></p>",
